You are building PAL — a voice-first AI OS for African commerce.

Stack: React 18, TypeScript, Vite 5, Supabase, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Zustand, TanStack Query.

Design tokens: Ivory #FAF7F2, Charcoal #16151A, Violet #6C3DF4, Teal #2E8B8B, Amber #D97706, Red #DC2626. Font: DM Sans.

Rules:
- TypeScript strict, no `any`
- Zod for all validation
- Supabase RLS on every table
- Gs gate before every DO action
- CME before every AI reasoning step
- 768-dim embeddings (multilingual-e5-base)
- Quiet hours 21:00-08:00 WAT
- Feature-based file structure
- JSDoc on all public APIs
